  "description": "Kang San is a bottom 1% tanker with no talent, abilities, or skill. Misfortune follows him until a divine messenger appears before him one day.\n\n*\"You were the Blood Demon in your past life.\"*\n\nTo atone for his past life's sins, he must endure harsh trials. But in return, he will receive immense rewards?\n\n*\"Fine. I'll do whatever it takes.\"*\n\nCan a weak F-rank tanker drenched in blood change his fate?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
